        <div class=3D"azq-question-body">
          <p class=3D"azq-question-text" id=3D"azq-q1-text"><span class=3D"=
azq-question-number">Question 1:</span> Which Azure feature allows you to e=
nforce governance across multiple subscriptions by defining rules and ensur=
ing compliance?</p>
          <ul class=3D"azq-options">
            <li class=3D"azq-option"><input autocomplete=3D"off" id=3D"q1a"=
