          <p class=3D"azq-question-text" id=3D"azq-q4-text"><span class=3D"=
azq-question-number">Question 4:</span> Which Azure feature enables users t=
o request time-bound, approval-based access to critical resources?</p>
          <ul class=3D"azq-options">
            <li class=3D"azq-option"><input autocomplete=3D"off" id=3D"q4a"=
 name=3D"q4" type=3D"radio" value=3D"a"><label for=3D"q4a"><span>Privileged=
 Identity Management (PIM)</span></label></li>
            <li class=3D"azq-option"><input autocomplete=3D"off" id=3D"q4b"=
 name=3D"q4" type=3D"radio" value=3D"b"><label for=3D"q4b"><span>Access Rev=
iews</span></label></li>
            <li class=3D"azq-option"><input autocomplete=3D"off" id=3D"q4c"=
 name=3D"q4" type=3D"radio" value=3D"c"><label for=3D"q4c"><span>Azure Key =
Vault</span></label></li>
            <li class=3D"azq-option"><input autocomplete=3D"off" id=3D"q4d"=
 name=3D"q4" type=3D"radio" value=3D"d"><label for=3D"q4d"><span>Conditiona=
l Access</span></label></li>
          </ul>
          <button class=3D"azq-explain-toggle" type=3D"button" aria-expande=
d=3D"true" aria-controls=3D"azq-305-practice-test-1-explanation-4" data-azq=
-explain-toggle=3D"" aria-disabled=3D"false" style=3D"display: inline-flex;=
" fdprocessedid=3D"id90cw">Hide explanation</button><div class=3D"azq-expla=
nation is-open" id=3D"azq-305-practice-test-1-explanation-4">
            <h3>The correct answer is Privileged Identity Management (PIM).=
</h3>
            <p>Azure PIM allows administrators to provide just-in-time priv=
ileged access to resources, reducing the risks associated with standing adm=
inistrative permissions. Users can request access for a specific period, an=
d administrators can require approval or enforce MFA as part of the process=
. PIM also provides audit logs and alerts for any changes or unusual activi=
ties related to privileged roles. This helps organizations maintain tight c=
ontrol over high-risk permissions. By leveraging PIM, you reduce the attack=
 surface and ensure compliance with best security practices.</p>
            <h4>Related Microsoft Learn topic</h4>
