azq-question-number">Question 7:</span> Which tasks are possible with Azure=
 Monitor? Choose 2 answers.</p>
          <ul class=3D"azq-options">
            <li class=3D"azq-option"><input autocomplete=3D"off" id=3D"q7a"=
