ompliance with policies</span></label></li>
            <li class=3D"azq-option"><input autocomplete=3D"off" id=3D"q7d"=
 name=3D"q7" type=3D"checkbox" value=3D"d"><label for=3D"q7d"><span>Collect=
 and analyze log data</span></label></li>
            <li class=3D"azq-option"><input autocomplete=3D"off" id=3D"q7e"=
 name=3D"q7" type=3D"checkbox" value=3D"e"><label for=3D"q7e"><span>Manage =
Azure billing</span></label></li>
