-correct=3D"true" data-question=3D"10" data-type=3D"true-false" data-catego=
ry=3D"Design identity, governance, and monitoring solutions">
        <div class=3D"azq-question-body">
          <p class=3D"azq-question-text" id=3D"azq-q10-text"><span class=3D=
"azq-question-number">Question 10:</span> Azure Policy can automatically re=
mediate non-compliant resources.</p>
          <ul class=3D"azq-options">
            <li class=3D"azq-option"><input autocomplete=3D"off" id=3D"q10t=
rue" name=3D"q10" type=3D"radio" value=3D"true"><label for=3D"q10true"><spa=
n>True</span></label></li>
