            <p>By default, Azure activity logs are retained for 90 days, no=
t 365. If you need longer retention, you must configure diagnostic settings=
 to export logs to an Azure Storage account or Log Analytics workspace. Thi=
s extended retention can be critical for meeting compliance and auditing re=
quirements. Failing to configure additional retention could result in lost =
audit data after the default period. Always plan log retention in line with=
 your organization's regulatory needs.</p>
