            <h3>The correct answer is Azure Blob Storage.</h3>
            <p>Azure Blob Storage is designed specifically to store massive=
 amounts of unstructured data such as text, images, video, and backups. It =
provides high durability and scalability, supporting workloads from small p=
ersonal projects to global enterprise needs. Blobs can be accessed over HTT=
P/HTTPS and are integrated with features like lifecycle management, redunda=
ncy, and security. Blob Storage also supports data lake analytics for big d=
ata processing. Its flexibility and performance make it ideal for storing b=
inary large objects.</p>
