ns.</h3>
            <p>Availability Zones distribute resources across physically se=
parate datacenters within an Azure region, protecting against datacenter-le=
vel failures and reducing downtime. Update Domains, used in availability se=
ts, ensure that not all instances of a resource are updated at the same tim=
e during maintenance. This allows applications to remain available even dur=
ing platform updates. By combining these features, organizations can achiev=
e high availability and business continuity. Proper use of both is a best p=
ractice for critical production workloads.</p>
