mmunication between resources. ExpressRoute Global Reach extends private co=
nnectivity across on-premises and Azure networks worldwide. Both options en=
sure secure data transfer and support hybrid or multi-region architectures.=
 Implementing these solutions helps organizations build resilient, globally=
 distributed infrastructures. Security and performance are both improved by=
 avoiding public internet routes.</p>
